cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GateMem: Benchmarking Memory Governance in Multi-Principal Shared-Memory Agents"
message: "If you use GateMem, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: dataset
abstract: "GateMem is a synthetic benchmark for evaluating utility, access control, and active forgetting in multi-principal shared-memory agents."
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - memory governance
  - access control
  - active forgetting
  - benchmark
license: CC-BY-4.0
